[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2340.95, "timestamp": "00:39:00", "text": "就像一件黑色紧身衣之类的东西，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2343.75, "timestamp": "00:39:03", "text": "太美了，我当时就想，天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2346.95, "timestamp": "00:39:06", "text": "我可以做到这件事。所以，当时我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2350.23, "timestamp": "00:39:10", "text": "我正在制作我的黑发模特，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2353.349, "timestamp": "00:39:13", "text": "记住它。呃，那是第一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2355.349, "timestamp": "00:39:15", "text": "模型"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2357.971, "timestamp": "00:39:17", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "suppppppppppp"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2358.15, "timestamp": "00:39:18", "text": "呃，我玩《Valerant》之类的游戏的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2361.75, "timestamp": "00:39:21", "text": "是的，那是我的第一个模型。后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2364.87, "timestamp": "00:39:24", "text": "我开始了Hyperola这个项目，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2368.95, "timestamp": "00:39:28", "text": "然后我开始说我可以做YouTube。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2372.069, "timestamp": "00:39:32", "text": "然后开启流媒体模式等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2374.63, "timestamp": "00:39:34", "text": "我告诉家人我将要做什么"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2375.536, "timestamp": "00:39:35", "author": "@irumaVT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9ybSHxr-ali9lBPfsyuUVuKpIevGpkL17bcUltOiPnYPm0EeyQBNGQpGBfpZmwWdz7QqUrf6=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wah"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2376.71, "timestamp": "00:39:36", "text": "直播的时候，他们就像在问：这是什么？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2377.814, "timestamp": "00:39:37", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Iruma Vitale VT~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2378.71, "timestamp": "00:39:38", "text": "你甚至觉得我有能力做到这一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2381.829, "timestamp": "00:39:41", "text": "我当时就想，兄弟，别评判我，但我还是会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2386.63, "timestamp": "00:39:46", "text": "正在这样做。于是我照做了，然后开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2389.829, "timestamp": "00:39:49", "text": "直播一段时间，比如一小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2392.23, "timestamp": "00:39:52", "text": "然后事情继续发展，我的父母"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2394.47, "timestamp": "00:39:54", "text": "还看到它运行良好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2396.79, "timestamp": "00:39:56", "text": "回应就像人们真的关心一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2398.87, "timestamp": "00:39:58", "text": "关于我之类的。所以他们就像"}]